{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015gAWZ1MjY2vo2rujeiMBTJ","type":"tool_result","content":"### Bahagian A: Padanan / Matching (10 marks)\n### Bahagian A: Soalan Jawapan Pendek / Short Answer (15 marks)\n### Bahagian A: Soalan Pelbagai Pilihan / Multiple Choice (10 marks)\n### Bahagian B: Betul atau Salah / True or False (10 marks)\n### Bahagian B: Betul atau Salah / True or False (5 marks)\n### Bahagian B: Isi Tempat Kosong / Fill in the Blanks (10 marks)\n### Bahagian B: Soalan Jawapan Pendek / Short Answer (15 marks)\n### Bahagian C: Betul atau Salah / True or False (5 marks)\n### Bahagian C: Senario / Scenario Question (15 marks)\n### Bahagian C: Soalan Esei / Essay (15 marks)\n### Bahagian C: Soalan Jawapan Pendek / Short Answer (10 marks)\n### Bahagian C: Tugasan Praktikal / Practical Writing Task (20 marks)\n### Bahagian D: Rajah / Diagram Labelling (10 marks)\n### Bahagian D: Soalan Esei / Essay (10 marks)\n### Q1 — List\n### Q1 — Matching\n### Q1 — Multiple Choice\n### Q1 — Short Answer\n### Q2 — Matching\n### Q2 — Multiple Choice\n### Q2 — Short Answer\n### Q3 — Multiple Choice\n### Q3 — Short Answer\n### Q3 — True or False (with justification)\n### Q4 — Multiple Choice\n### Q4 — Short Answer\n### Q4 — True or False (with justification)\n### Q5 — Matching\n### Q5 — Multiple Choice\n### Q5 — Short Answer\n### Q5 — True or False (with justification)\n### Q6 — Short Answer\n### Question 1 — Multiple Choice (Soalan Aneka Pilihan)\n### Question 2 — Calculation (Pengiraan)\n### Question 2 — Matching (Padanan)\n### Question 2 — Short Answer (Jawapan Pendek)\n### Question 2 — True or False (Betul atau Salah)\n### Question 3 — Diagram Labelling (Pelabelan Rajah)\n### Question 3 — Short Answer (Jawapan Pendek)\n### Question 3 — True or False (Betul atau Salah)\n### Question 4 — Matching (Padanan)\n### Question 4 — Short Answer (Jawapan Pendek)\n### Question 4 — True or False (Betul atau Salah)\n### Question 5 — Matching (Padanan)\n### Question 5 — Multiple Choice (Soalan Aneka Pilihan)\n### Question 5 — Short Answer (Jawapan Pendek)\n### Question 6 — Multiple Choice (Soalan Aneka Pilihan)\n### Question 6 — Short Answer (Jawapan Pendek)\n### Question 7 — True or False (Betul atau Salah)\n### Question 8 — Short Answer (Jawapan Pendek)\n### S1\n### S1 — MCQ: What special service tool is unique to drive train work? A. Diagnostic scan tool B. Oil seal installer C. Safety box D. Fire extinguisher\n### S1 — Multiple Choice\n### S1 — Short Answer\n### S1 — Short Answer: a) Explain the function of the inverter in a BEV. b) List FOUR main components inside an inverter unit.\n### S1 — Short Answer: a) Explain the two braking methods in a BEV and how they work together. b) How much range extension does regenerative braking typically provide?\n### S1 — Short Answer: a) What is an e-axle and what three components does it integrate? b) Why do most BEVs use a single-speed fixed-ratio reduction?\n### S1 — Short Answer: a) What is TNI (Training Needs Identification)? b) What is TNA (Training Needs Analysis)? Explain how they differ.\n### S1 — Short Answer: Compare PSM and ASM motor types. List TWO advantages of each.\n### S1 — Short Answer: List FOUR (4) employer responsibilities and FOUR (4) employee responsibilities under OSHA 1994 relevant to a BEV workshop.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"390bd59f-ce55-4c9a-9b2a-1ff7d2e0d4e9","uuid":"f7e3af7c-da9c-4cd8-a3e5-d52b775cddb8","timestamp":"2026-04-17T02:46:46.054Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### Bahagian A: Padanan / Matching (10 marks)\n### Bahagian A: Soalan Jawapan Pendek / Short Answer (15 marks)\n### Bahagian A: Soalan Pelbagai Pilihan / Multiple Choice (10 marks)\n### Bahagian B: Betul atau Salah / True or False (10 marks)\n### Bahagian B: Betul atau Salah / True or False (5 marks)\n### Bahagian B: Isi Tempat Kosong / Fill in the Blanks (10 marks)\n### Bahagian B: Soalan Jawapan Pendek / Short Answer (15 marks)\n### Bahag